{"path":"thread/thrd_join","title":"thrd_join","titleHtml":"thrd_join","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/c/thread/thrd_join","section":"thread","kind":"page","summary":"Blocks the current thread until the thread identified by thr finishes execution.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/c/thread\"><code>&lt;threads.h&gt;</code></a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-c11\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi c source-c\"><span class=\"kw4\">int</span> thrd_join<span class=\"br0\">(</span> <a href=\"/w/c/thread\"><span class=\"kw996\">thrd_t</span></a> thr, <span class=\"kw4\">int</span> <span class=\"sy2\">*</span>res <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-c11\">(since C11)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Blocks the current thread until the thread identified by <code>thr</code> finishes execution.\n</p><p>If <code>res</code> is not a null pointer, the result code of the thread is put to the location pointed to by <code>res</code>.\n</p><p>The termination of the thread <i>synchronizes-with</i> the completion of this function.\n</p><p>The behavior is undefined if the thread was previously detached or joined by another thread.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td>  thr\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td>  identifier of the thread to join\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td>  res\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td>  location to put the result code to\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p><span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/c/thread/thrd_errors\">thrd_success</a></span> if successful, <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/c/thread/thrd_errors\">thrd_error</a></span> otherwise.\n</p>\n<h3 